{"speciesId":189,"names":{"fr":"Cotovol","es":"Jumpluff","en":"Jumpluff","ja":"ワタッコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Once it catches the wind, it deft­ ly controls its cotton-puff spores to float, even around the world."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Drifts on seasonal winds and spreads its cotton-like spores all over the world to make more offspring."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Even in the fierc­ est wind, it can control its fluff to make its way to any place in the world it wants."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"JUMPLUFF rides warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. The POKéMON descends to the ground when it encounters cold air while it is floating."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"JUMPLUFF rides warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. The POKéMON descends to the ground when it encounters cold air while it is floating."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"JUMPLUFF ride warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. This POKéMON lands when it encounters cold air while it is floating."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It drifts on seasonal winds and spreads its cotton-like spores all over the world to make more offspring."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Once it catches the wind, it deftly controls its cotton-puff spores to float, even around the world."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Once it catches the wind, it deftly controls its cotton-puff spores-- it can even float around the world."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Drifts on seasonal winds and spreads its cotton-like spores all over the world to make more offspring."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Poussé par les vents saisonniers, il fait le tour du globe en semant des spores de coton."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Poussé par les vents saisonniers, il fait le tour du globe en semant des spores de coton."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Poussé par les vents saisonniers, il fait le tour du globe en semant des spores de coton."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Los vientos estacionales lo llevan por todo el mundo, donde va soltando sus esporas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"季節風に 流されて 世界を １周してしまう。 途中で 綿胞子を ばらまく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Même sous un vent très violent, il contrôle sa destination en bougeant ses appendices."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Aunque sople el viento más fuerte, es capaz de controlar los pompones y moverse por donde quiera."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Even in the fiercest wind, it can control its fluff to make its way to any place in the world it wants."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"どんな 風に あおられても 綿毛を 自在に 操って 世界の 好きなところへ 行ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cotovol traverse la mer, porté par les vents, pour découvrir de nouveaux territoires. Ce Pokémon se rapproche du sol quand le vent est trop froid."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Jumpluff se vale de los cálidos vientos del sur para volar a tierras lejanas. Si llega a zonas de aire frío en pleno vuelo, descenderá y tomará tierra."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Jumpluff rides warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. The Pokémon descends to the ground when it encounters cold air while it is floating."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"暖かい 南風に 乗って 海を 越え 外国まで 飛んでいってしまう ポケモン。 冷たい 空気に 触れると 地面に 降りる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cotovol traverse la mer, porté par les vents, pour découvrir de nouveaux territoires. Ce Pokémon se rapproche du sol quand le vent est trop froid."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jumpluff se vale de los cálidos vientos del sur para volar a tierras lejanas. Si llega a zonas de aire frío en pleno vuelo, descenderá y tomará tierra."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jumpluff rides warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. The Pokémon descends to the ground when it encounters cold air while it is floating."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"暖かい 南風に 乗って 海を 越え 外国まで 飛んでいってしまう ポケモン。 冷たい 空気に 触れると 地面に 降りる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":189,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",10],[4,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",10],[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",10],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",10],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",10],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",10],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up"